{"is_source_file": true, "format": "shell script", "description": "This script monitors and manages the hostapd process for WiFi radios on a device. It reads status files for radio enablement and SSID enablement, queries device management via dmcli, checks whether hostapd instances are running for different interfaces, and attempts to restart hostapd if necessary. It runs perpetually in a loop to ensure WiFi services are active as configured.", "external_files": ["/var/Get2gRadioEnable.txt", "/var/Get5gRadioEnable.txt", "/var/GetgssidEnable.txt", "/var/GetPub2gssidEnable.txt", "/var/GetPub5gssidEnable.txt", "/nvram/hostapd0.conf", "/nvram/hostapd1.conf", "/nvram/hostapd4.conf", "/nvram/hostapd5.conf"], "external_methods": ["cat", "grep", "cut", "ps", "sleep", "modprobe", "rmmod", "hostapd"], "published": [], "classes": [], "methods": [{"name": "hostapd_check", "description": "Checks if a hostapd process for a given WiFi interface index is running; if not, attempts to restart it."}], "calls": ["cat /var/Get2gRadioEnable.txt", "cat /var/Get5gRadioEnable.txt", "cat /var/GetgssidEnable.txt", "cat /var/GetPub2gssidEnable.txt", "cat /var/GetPub5gssidEnable.txt", "dmcli eRT getv Device.WiFi.SSID.1.Enable", "dmcli eRT getv Device.WiFi.SSID.5.Enable", "dmcli eRT getv Device.WiFi.SSID.2.Enable", "dmcli eRT getv Device.WiFi.SSID.6.Enable", "ps aux", "grep hostapd", "wc -l", "rmmod brcmfmac", "sleep 1", "modprobe brcmfmac", "sleep 2", "hostapd -B /nvram/hostapd0.conf", "hostapd -B /nvram/hostapd1.conf", "hostapd -B /nvram/hostapd4.conf", "hostapd -B /nvram/hostapd5.conf"], "search-terms": ["hostapd", "WiFi Radio", "dmcli", "ssids", "radio enablement", "hostapd process check", "WiFi configuration"], "state": 2, "file_id": 1866, "knowledge_revision": 28527, "git_revision": "7e30f88c4ca54db6e79d70eb5e919c86fb3e3bcf", "hash": "4022953752e851b74f6b7ea3f55f2684", "format-version": 4, "code-base-name": "kirkstone-7931", "filename": "meta-cmf-raspberrypi/recipes-connectivity/hostapd/ho